    {
      "id": "zJ54FkUmKxsks-59KWylm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -885.6344704396062,
      "y": 6781.155160489648,
      "width": 310.019775390625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3d3d3d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1475186083,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 1968189773,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774626146937,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n- Just a metadata layer\n- underlying blob doesn't change\n- tracks as first class object\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n- Just a metadata layer\n- underlying blob doesn't change\n- tracks as first class object\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FGLOpaBEJukK-X6BZ4Axu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1274.7626140017162,
      "y": 6922.7325777955475,
      "width": 1108.899169921875,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3d3d3d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 62011501,
      "version": 658,
      "versionNonce": 1559843875,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774628091892,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What does it actually changes ?\n\n- Directory Rename without moving underlying blob\n- Deleting a directory is a recursive metadata delete\n- Atomis writes - Spark DFs write there output to an _temporary directory then commmit by renaminging that dir\n\n                       - it either succeeds completely or fails \n                       - no partial state\n                       - Delete the temp loc if fails and rerun\n                       - without HNs its a copy-and-delete, \n                       - if fails at 4M out of 10M files - output split across to paths, pipeline shows success.\n\n                 ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What does it actually changes ?\n\n- Directory Rename without moving underlying blob\n- Deleting a directory is a recursive metadata delete\n- Atomis writes - Spark DFs write there output to an _temporary directory then commmit by renaminging that dir\n\n                       - it either succeeds completely or fails \n                       - no partial state\n                       - Delete the temp loc if fails and rerun\n                       - without HNs its a copy-and-delete, \n                       - if fails at 4M out of 10M files - output split across to paths, pipeline shows success.\n\n                 ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
