      "updated": 1774631576434,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHY ADLS - GEN2",
      "fontSize": 23.63576092408778,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHY ADLS - GEN2",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "q6IWpZfk-avFmXVYRnyOy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 392.3640653572476,
      "y": 6113.4784104350965,
      "width": 769.7394409179688,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c2255c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1026546477,
      "version": 416,
      "versionNonce": 1847377421,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774629814668,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Problems with BLOB -\n \n1. Folders were illusion -  renaming was copy - and- delete activty \n                            \n\n2. Not ATOMIC - Spark job fails mid-rename \n                    → 50% data in old path, 50% in new path \n                    → downstream picks up partial data \n                   → silent corruption\n\n\n3. Access control (All or Nothing) -  Contractor reads Q4 reports \n                                           → sees raw payroll files in same container \n                                           → security incident\n\n\n4 Performance at scale -  Directory listing on 100M-file account = 45 seconds \n                                → Databricks Auto Loader crawls \n                                → SLA breach on morning reporting",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Problems with BLOB -\n \n1. Folders were illusion -  renaming was copy - and- delete activty \n                            \n\n2. Not ATOMIC - Spark job fails mid-rename \n                    → 50% data in old path, 50% in new path \n                    → downstream picks up partial data \n                   → silent corruption\n\n\n3. Access control (All or Nothing) -  Contractor reads Q4 reports \n                                           → sees raw payroll files in same container \n                                           → security incident\n\n\n4 Performance at scale -  Directory listing on 100M-file account = 45 seconds \n                                → Databricks Auto Loader crawls \n                                → SLA breach on morning reporting",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IBlOKU4n85Og7kbhZVMOd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 325.54322876714673,
      "y": 7438.801126910621,
      "width": 99.59994506835938,
      "height": 23,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3d3d3d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2094168099,
      "version": 493,
      "versionNonce": 1402026467,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774632734073,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Use cases - ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Use cases - ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "ULtIKXK7PD8MCVi5awCzT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 329.4459723959178,
      "y": 7480.779935012716,
      "width": 484.53961181640625,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3d3d3d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1213324035,
      "version": 503,
      "versionNonce": 1169556867,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774632734073,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n1. A major bank processes 50 million transactions \n    per day from 200 branch systems. \n   Raw transaction files arrive as CSV from \n   each branch every hour. Multiple teams \n  need access: Risk needs raw data, \n  Compliance needs curated, \n  Reporting needs aggregates. \n They were running all on-premises HDFS. \n Disaster recovery was essentially nonexistent. \nStorage costs were 15 times the cloud equivalen",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n1. A major bank processes 50 million transactions \n    per day from 200 branch systems. \n   Raw transaction files arrive as CSV from \n   each branch every hour. Multiple teams \n  need access: Risk needs raw data, \n  Compliance needs curated, \n  Reporting needs aggregates. \n They were running all on-premises HDFS. \n Disaster recovery was essentially nonexistent. \nStorage costs were 15 times the cloud equivalen",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OoxPToi_fH4IuPq1ls7sL",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 848.4803848378646,
      "y": 7614.126335219554,
      "width": 115.550177086992,
      "height": 2.5001951371814357,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3d3d3d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
