      "seed": 1118206051,
      "version": 807,
      "versionNonce": 871346275,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774632734073,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n2. A retailer with 8,000 SKUs and 3 million\ncustomers generates clickstream events, inventory\nsnapshots, and order events from five different\nsource systems. Each source team manages their\nown flat-file exports. Data lands wherever\nengineers happen to put it. The downstream ML\nteam can never reliably find the data they need\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n2. A retailer with 8,000 SKUs and 3 million customers generates clickstream events, inventory snapshots, and order events from five different source systems. Each source team manages their own flat-file exports. Data lands wherever engineers happen to put it. The downstream ML team can never reliably find the data they need\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
