    {
      "id": "GPmOMXhuIcmS4Sm74vfA2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1001.6503026324203,
      "y": 7858.798907225143,
      "width": 658.7994995117188,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 257387171,
      "version": 795,
      "versionNonce": 999502755,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774632734073,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ADLS Gen2 with an organized folder hierarchy — \n/raw/source system/year/month/day/hour. \nStandardized naming across every source. \n\nThe ML team gets read access to the silver zone only. \nEach source team's ADF pipeline gets Contributor access \nto only their ingestion path. \n\nScale: 500 gigabytes per day, 3 terabytes monthly retention in raw,\n         800 gigabytes in silver. \n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ADLS Gen2 with an organized folder hierarchy — \n/raw/source system/year/month/day/hour. \nStandardized naming across every source. \n\nThe ML team gets read access to the silver zone only. \nEach source team's ADF pipeline gets Contributor access \nto only their ingestion path. \n\nScale: 500 gigabytes per day, 3 terabytes monthly retention in raw,\n         800 gigabytes in silver. \n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5yYq75xmelHgHEpIIcqr6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 305.2761170777202,
      "y": 8209.440858905331,
      "width": 511.03341061547025,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3d3d3d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 545033613,
      "version": 1132,
      "versionNonce": 1456654147,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774632734073,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. A clinical research organization collects patient\ndata from 15 hospital partners. HIPAA regulations\nrequire strict data isolation — Hospital A must\nnever be able to read Hospital B's data, even if\nthey are in the same storage account.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. A clinical research organization collects patient data from 15 hospital partners. HIPAA regulations require strict data isolation — Hospital A must  never be able to read Hospital B's data, even if they are in the same storage account.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Pr_gbfYvrc7IBLwj0lFCZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 984.1675499161247,
      "y": 8173.403834597785,
      "width": 723.0595092773438,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1605570883,
      "version": 953,
      "versionNonce": 2015291107,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774632734073,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ADLS Gen2 with per-partner folder hierarchy and \nPOSIX ACLs applied at the folder level. \n\nEach hospital's service principal has ACL access only to \n/raw/partner_hospital ID. \nThe shared silver layer is accessible to a controlled analytics group only. \n\nScale: 20 gigabytes per day, 500 gigabytes total, high audit requirement. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ADLS Gen2 with per-partner folder hierarchy and \nPOSIX ACLs applied at the folder level. \n\nEach hospital's service principal has ACL access only to \n/raw/partner_hospital ID. \nThe shared silver layer is accessible to a controlled analytics group only. \n\nScale: 20 gigabytes per day, 500 gigabytes total, high audit requirement. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
